## Why GPL-3.0

Av1ation Station links `andean-condor`, which is licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0. Statically or dynamically linking a
GPL-licensed library into an application makes the combined work a
derivative work, which must be distributed under the same license.

See docs/decisions.md (D12) for the full rationale.

## Third-party components

