- av-decoders — GPL-3.0
- av-scenechange — GPL-3.0
- av-metrics-vmaf, av-metrics-vship, av-metrics-fmetrics — GPL-3.0

Each retains its own copyright and license notice. The source code for
each is available from its respective upstream repository.

